lain why the way the word is used by  the majority people is wrong like why is  it wrong if that's how the majority  people use it words can evolve meaning  the meaning of words can evolve  and i only hope that the word the use of  the word linguist spreads into other  languages  and i always get back to that other part  of my previous  video and that is  the easiest way to become fluent in  another language is to begin with a  major effort on input it's not  complicated just listen and read and  build your vocabulary and that's what  they did in the middle ages and that  gets you to a level where you can  actually understand and so once you've  got  your comprehension up you can understand  you are now in a position to engage  people in conversation to communicate  meaningfully and once that starts to  happen then your language can really  improve of course you need to speak of  course you need to speak a lot to become  a fluent speaker but you first have to  get to the first rung of the ladder and  that first run of the ladder is to  understand and the best way to get there  is through a lot of input-based learning  you have to put in the time you have to  have the attitude you have to believe  you can do it and you have to start  noticing what's happening so again the  elevator  uh  speech or whatever the simple thing  about language learning is learn the  words and phrases learn what they mean  learn how they sound and then take it  from there and become a linguist  thank you for listening
 

